/**
 * rb_subbuf_addr - Return the address of the start of a subbuffer
 * @cpu_buffer: The cpu buffer that @addr is on
 * @addr: An address of an event on a subbuffer
 *
 * Returns: The start of the subbuffer for where @addr sits
