  * Audio playback and recording
  * CAN
  * Debug UART
  * eMMC
  * Ethernet
  * GPIO buttons
  * Heartbeat LED
  * I2C EEPROM
  * I2C RTC
  * Micro SD card
  * SPI NOR flash
  * SPI Accelerometer
  * USB

